// Probes every generated Series wrapper with the receiver (and any Series
// argument) tracked, and classifies whether the output carries a reverse-mode
// node back to the input -- the Series-engine analogue of "does this ATen op
// register a grad_fn" (see the local PyTorch checkout's
// tools/autograd/derivatives.yaml). See the module docstring in
// tools/audit/gen_series_backward_manifest.py for the full classification.
// Writes the full manifest to series_backward_manifest.txt in the run
// directory.

